      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=h584u3h4r7]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=h584u3h4r7]{color:#b2b2b2}[data-colorid=z535mrkx2p]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=z535mrkx2p]{color:#b2b2b2}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureMedicationData-Description\">Description</h2><p><span data-colorid=\"z535mrkx2p\">In Bahmni, reference data needs to be present in multiple systems/databases. In the case of Medication (Drugs), it is more complex, as it is stored in a completely different domain.</span></p><p>Earlier<span data-colorid=\"h584u3h4r7\">&nbsp;versions of Bahmni had an application dedicated for reference data setup. The current version uses OpenMRS as the main recognized application for reference data setup</span>.&nbsp;OpenMRS gives a lot of flexibility since it recognizes everything as Concepts. So all resources like tests, panels, samples, departments, drugs are concepts in OpenMRS. Drugs are also recognized as a separate resource in OpenMRS, but their setup is a little different from the other resources.</p><h2 id=\"ConfigureMedicationData-AddMedication/DrugData\">Add Medication / Drug Data</h2><p>There are two ways to configure Medication Data: via OpenMRS or via CSV Upload as detailed below</p><h3 id=\"ConfigureMedicationData-1.AddviaOpenMRS\">1.&nbsp;Add via&nbsp;OpenMRS</h3><ul><li>Drugs exist as a separate entity in OpenMRS but they also require a concept linking.</li><li>To create a new drug/medication, there first needs to be a generic concept that depicts the generic drug.<br /><strong>For Example:&nbsp;</strong><br /><ul><li>If there are drugs like Paracetamol 2mg, Paracetamol 500mg tablet etc. &nbsp;they needs to be a generic concept &quot;Paracetamol&quot; created. The concept created for drug must be of concept class &quot;Drug&quot;.&nbsp;</li><li><span>Then a drug can be created which is linked to the generic concept. The drug can have a dosage form, maximum/minimum daily dose and strength.</span></li></ul></li></ul><p style=\"margin-left: 90.0px;\"><em><span>Concept - &quot;Paracetamol&quot; - Concept Class - &quot;Drug&quot;</span></em></p><p style=\"margin-left: 90.0px;\">Drug 1 - &quot;Paracetamol 2mg&quot; - Dosage Form - &quot;Injection&quot; - Strength - &quot;2mg&quot; Concept - &quot;Paracetamol&quot;<br />Drug 2 - &quot;Paracetamol 500mg&quot; - Dosage Form - &quot;Tablet&quot; - Strength - &quot;500mg&quot; Concept - &quot;Paracetamol&quot;</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Paracetamol%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996549&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=357\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114727368/Paracetamol%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996549&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114727621\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Paracetamol Concept.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114727368\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"36b0f2e6-4fed-439b-8a93-1536cfd07057\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Paracetamol%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996549&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=714 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Paracetamol%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996549&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=357 1x\" /></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;text-align: center;\"><strong>Sample Screenshot of Concept Paracetamol in OpenMRS</strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;text-align: center;\"><strong><br /></strong></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Paracetamol%2060ml%20drug.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488190783583&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=541&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114727368/Paracetamol%2060ml%20drug.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488190783583&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115017797\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Paracetamol 60ml drug.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114727368\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"4a47ec2e-19b1-47ac-a08f-7058a4fd806a\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Paracetamol%2060ml%20drug.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488190783583&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1082&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Paracetamol%2060ml%20drug.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488190783583&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=541&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sample Screenshot of Drug Paracetamol 60ml in OpenMRS</strong></p><p><br /></p><p>There is a many-to-one relationship between Drugs and Concepts belonging to concept class &quot;Drug&quot;.</p><p>When a new Drug is created, an event is published from OpenMRS in the atom-feed. The &quot;OpenERP Atom Feed Service&quot; will then consume the events from OpenMRS and then create the drug details in OpenERP. The Drug in OpenMRS is mapped to Product in OpenERP. The fields are mapped as follows:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col /><col /></colgroup><thead><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><p>OpenMRS</p></th><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><p>OpenERP</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">uuid</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">uuid</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">name</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">name</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">shortName</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">default_code</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">genericName</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">drug</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">dosageForm</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">categ_id - id of product.category table</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The process of synchronization between various components can be found&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Atom+Feed+Based+Synchronization+in+Bahmni\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a>.</p><p><br /></p><p><strong>Note:&nbsp;</strong>A drug can be retired/deleted from the &quot;Manage Drug Concepts&quot; OpenMRS page</p><h3 id=\"ConfigureMedicationData-2.AddviaCSVimportinBahmni\"><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">2. Add via CSV import in Bahmni</span></h3><ol><li><p>Upload concept CSV for Drug Dosage Forms</p><p>Sample file:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/12320770/Drug_Dosage_Forms_concepts.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1429266164295&amp;api=v2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Drug_Dosage_Forms_concepts.csv</a></p></li><li><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">Upload concept CSV for Generic Drug concepts</span></li></ol><p><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sample file:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/12320770/Drug_Generic_Name_concepts.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1429266111142&amp;api=v2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">Drug_Generic_Name_concepts.csv</span></a></p><p><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3. Upload drug CSV for Drug formulations.</span></p><p><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sample file:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/12320770/Drugs.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1429266203914&amp;api=v2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"8de44010-6716-428a-9584-5936a3bc4b52\">Drugs.csv</span></a></p><p><br /></p><p>The following screenshot details the steps for uploading Drug Data in Admin section</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Drug%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996965&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=380\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114727368/Drug%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996965&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114727625\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Drug Concept.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114727368\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"a31749a5-5f0e-4a11-a909-6743b6f967d8\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Drug%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996965&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1225&amp;height=666 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114727368/Drug%20Concept.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487228996965&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=380 1x\" /></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;text-align: center;\"><strong>Sample Screenshot of CSV Import in Admin Section</strong></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureMedicationData-3.AddDrugsviaCSVimportinOpenERP\">3. Add Drugs via CSV import in OpenERP</h3><p><br /></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureMedicationData-DeleteMedication/DrugData\">Delete Medication / Drug Data</h2><p>To delete medication/drug data please refer to the screencast and the outline steps below</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"980bbea7-fa3e-4f5b-94ed-88cd7dc8fed0\" data-macro-name=\"widget\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/yRZ-e3z58Us?wmode=opaque\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 300px\" type=\"text/html\">\n</iframe>\n    \n</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Delete Medication / Drug Data</strong><br /></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Login to OpenMRS</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">a. Select the Drug/Medication that you want to retire</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">b. Enter a &quot;Reason&quot; for retiring the drug. For e.g. &quot;Not used anymore&quot;</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">c. Click &quot;Retire the Drug&quot;</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">5. Login to OpenERP</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">a.Go to &quot;Products&quot; and search for the<span>&nbsp;Drug/Medication that was retired above.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">b. Click the &quot;More&quot; button and select &quot;Delete&quot; from the options.</span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7b3588e-96e1-4de3-a29d-46427cf35a1e\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"57f00d54-18c5-4df3-8868-07bea0850d0d\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
